{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 8400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Didi and Jeong Tae-woong's Life in Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9400,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11360,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13600,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Life in Korea is a podcast where two people living in Korea talk about the various aspects of life in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20840,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, today we're filming together on camera for the second time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25600,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a podcast that comes with video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28200,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's today's topic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30719,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today's topic is exercise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33959,
    "dDurationMs": 3121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exercise... exercise..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37080,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exercise is something I really should do, but I really don't want to do it, at least for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44520,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, do you exercise a lot these days?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47560,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48200,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You did a lot last year, didn't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50720,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, that came out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51880,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I did exercise a lot last year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54360,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right now I'm lacking in exercise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57000,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't do it at all?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58439,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do a little. Really a little. A little that's no different from not doing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62320,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do you do it? What do you do? Even if it's just a little?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65320,
    "dDurationMs": 5639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I go to the park in front of my house in the morning for a walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70959,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pull-ups."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73239,
    "dDurationMs": 3081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like five or six of them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76320,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I come back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80199,
    "dDurationMs": 921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exercise done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81120,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exercise done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83040,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you do it today too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84040,
    "dDurationMs": 1599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did today as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86040,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, going out is something, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88360,
    "dDurationMs": 5479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I feel like I really have to do at least that, so I'm forcing myself to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93839,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why did you stop doing it so much this year?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97599,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I did it so hard last year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100239,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Burnout?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102160,
    "dDurationMs": 4799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems similar to burnout."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106959,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I thought, what if I just don't do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110879,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What happens if I don't?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112239,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What happens if I don't?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114320,
    "dDurationMs": 5639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does exercising consistently really make that big of a difference, like people say?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119959,
    "dDurationMs": 5081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I did an experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125040,
    "dDurationMs": 9040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How is it? Now that five months have passed and you're not exercising, do you feel a change?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134080,
    "dDurationMs": 8280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, I don't think you can say that life is good or bad because of just one thing in such a definitive way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142360,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, it seems like exercising consistently is good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148600,
    "dDurationMs": 2679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what they say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151279,
    "dDurationMs": 3681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's good to do it hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154960,
    "dDurationMs": 14879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So far, has there been an exercise that you thought fit you best, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169839,
    "dDurationMs": 2321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172160,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exercise isn't about finding what fits. You just do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175080,
    "dDurationMs": 1559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, you just do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176639,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178720,
    "dDurationMs": 5479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then is there an exercise you paid for and learned?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184199,
    "dDurationMs": 6881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As for learning... I don't think there's anything I learned of my own will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191080,
    "dDurationMs": 4839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I learned Taekwondo when I was young."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195919,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But other than that, I don't think there's anything specific."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200479,
    "dDurationMs": 1401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about the gym?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202199,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I started going to the gym from when I was twenty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209399,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PT, which stands for Personal Training. I've never received that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214039,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then how did you know and do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217039,
    "dDurationMs": 7961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sorry for confusing things, but I've never paid for and received PT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225000,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I first went to the gym at twenty,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229360,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The trainer who was working there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232479,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just watched me exercising and taught me. For a while."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237240,
    "dDurationMs": 879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's free!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238119,
    "dDurationMs": 1601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was really great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239720,
    "dDurationMs": 3679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, why did you want to teach me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243399,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I was doing it in a really strange way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245240,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's not it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246559,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you do it like that, you'll get hurt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248960,
    "dDurationMs": 7279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I think about it now… what kind of feeling is this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256239,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I say it's a bit touching?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261399,
    "dDurationMs": 801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something sad?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262200,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I say it's sad?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263920,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it's more of a good memory than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268720,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My body was very weak from a young age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272200,
    "dDurationMs": 1639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My physique was also small and frail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273839,
    "dDurationMs": 6321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I had several major surgeries during middle and high school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280160,
    "dDurationMs": 2359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My body was extremely weak."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282519,
    "dDurationMs": 3641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like that even until I graduated high school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286160,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was around twenty or twenty-one years old, my mother"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292160,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because of my surgery records, I did go to the military for public service,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299160,
    "dDurationMs": 2399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I still had to go to boot camp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301559,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since this kid's body was so weak,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303959,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I sent him to boot camp like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306440,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he might struggle and not be able to do things properly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312000,
    "dDurationMs": 4399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So my mother took me to the gym."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316399,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, that makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319679,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You pay the registration fee and all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322160,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then to the trainer who was there at the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325320,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this kid's body is very weak and he doesn't exercise properly…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331480,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he did do taekwondo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333160,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but anyway, so before sending him to the military,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337200,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before sending him to boot camp, I should probably train him properly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341720,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I told them I was registering and I registered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346480,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how cute must a young boy have looked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353040,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how sad it must have seemed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355200,
    "dDurationMs": 2359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because his body was weak, it was like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357559,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so I went to the gym every early morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363359,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that trainer took me under his wing completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367079,
    "dDurationMs": 1641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, that's the best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368720,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, he taught me a lot of exercises."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373640,
    "dDurationMs": 2479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You really found a great place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376119,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, he's one of several noble people in my life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382359,
    "dDurationMs": 3121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, usually when it's like, the body is weak, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385480,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, then we have our personal training course like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389440,
    "dDurationMs": 3079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they could guide you through it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392519,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he did it for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394480,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, he was a very unique person too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399000,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400040,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, he wasn't someone who worked out professionally full-time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403320,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was originally someone who did his own business,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406880,
    "dDurationMs": 3679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he came back to Korea after working in America,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410559,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he just liked working out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414079,
    "dDurationMs": 5241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he thought his current lifestyle habits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419320,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be better if he were more of a morning person,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422799,
    "dDurationMs": 6841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he volunteered to work the counter at that gym that opens early in the morning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429640,
    "dDurationMs": 4879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because to open the gym he had to wake up early,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434519,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he worked in the morning like that and then clocked out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439320,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he worked out himself and helped people like me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443440,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he didn't take money for personal training or anything like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446600,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was a really unique person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447880,
    "dDurationMs": 2959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's something, unique indeed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450839,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His determination is remarkable, even so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452640,
    "dDurationMs": 3639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, this person had quite a big influence on my values."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456279,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really? You did it for quite a long time then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459640,
    "dDurationMs": 4719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I think I did it for over several months, around six months or so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464359,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465559,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you learned about fitness equipment and things like that back then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468320,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471480,
    "dDurationMs": 4919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, getting back to the topic of exercise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476399,
    "dDurationMs": 2361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like there's nothing else besides that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478760,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't learn anything else?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480160,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482160,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As someone who really dislikes exercise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487160,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've tried various things with the mindset of, well, if I pay for it I'll do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492760,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, when I was young, I took swimming lessons for quite a long time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497160,
    "dDurationMs": 3399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that was because my parents sent me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500559,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and as an adult, I've also tried things like personal training, briefly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505839,
