  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008000,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are a lot of women-only things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013200,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. There are women-only gyms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015399,
    "dDurationMs": 6801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Women-only gyms, women-only yoga, women-only Pilates—there are things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022200,
    "dDurationMs": 1639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you been to one?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023839,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I actually like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027359,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got PT at a women-only place, and I did yoga at a women-only place too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033000,
    "dDurationMs": 3079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got women-only PT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036079,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got PT at a women-only gym."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040119,
    "dDurationMs": 5361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the trainers were men."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045480,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I quit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050320,
    "dDurationMs": 1479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got a refund, a refund."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051799,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a bit of a contradiction there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053279,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was inconvenient, what was inconvenient?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057559,
    "dDurationMs": 7881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just don't want to think about anything, but then something comes up that makes me think about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065440,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a women-only gym but the trainers are men."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071040,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During PT, there are breaks, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076200,
    "dDurationMs": 7879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The conversations we'd have during those times, that wasn't fun either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084079,
    "dDurationMs": 4121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't like it, that experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088200,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like swimming, swimming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089640,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Swimming?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092720,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really want to learn swimming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095760,
    "dDurationMs": 1759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How about this summer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097519,
    "dDurationMs": 2201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think it'll work out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099720,
    "dDurationMs": 839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're busy, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100559,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104559,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Swimming is all good, it's really all good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109279,
    "dDurationMs": 5561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The process is really the most annoying part, I think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114840,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116440,
    "dDurationMs": 10440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to shower before you go, shower when you're done, dry your hair, and you have to wash your clothes every single day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126880,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you shower in the morning anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130880,
    "dDurationMs": 11880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I don't shower before going to the pool, I quickly shower in the shower room at the pool, swim, and then shower again to finish up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142760,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Either way, my hair is going to dry anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144719,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thinking about it that way feels nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146520,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't that how it is?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147640,
    "dDurationMs": 1399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wish I could do the morning session."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149039,
    "dDurationMs": 4841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I do the evening session, I might end up going twice, so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153880,
    "dDurationMs": 839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154719,
    "dDurationMs": 2121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The morning session sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156840,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I do it, I'm planning to swim in the morning too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159880,
    "dDurationMs": 3719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm thinking I might do it too, this year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1163599,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should look into morning swimming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1166640,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Swimming has the fun of leveling up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170080,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171080,
    "dDurationMs": 5599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, at first you do half kicking, what we call a kickboard?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176679,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do it while holding a tube or something, and gradually you move up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182119,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You learn freestyle, and you learn breaststroke like a frog."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188239,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you go higher, you can learn butterfly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193159,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must be pretty good at swimming, Didi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196039,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I haven't forgotten."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I heard that when you go to a swimming class, they divide it into beginner, intermediate, and advanced?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They do divide it, they do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about you, Didi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just do free swimming now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're at a stage where you don't need classes anymore?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. When I go, they just correct things like posture or technique based on what I already know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1228000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Free swimming is nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You did a lot of running last year, didn't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every single day for a whole year?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanted to run, and from January to July I ran without missing a single day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I got COVID in July, and from then on I couldn't run every single day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I went out every single day and either walked or ran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was really shocked when I heard that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you really did go out every single day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Literally, I really did go out every day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How about it? How's the running?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Running... well, actually, it's been several years since I started running,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1273000,
    "dDurationMs": 13000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now I can't even remember what the difference was like between when I wasn't running and after I started."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't remember what life was like before running?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. But it's really great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First of all, my fitness level went up, so I don't get tired as easily,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and these days I see a lot of people my age and younger friends who struggle even going up a few stairs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I don't have that problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think my fitness has really improved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316000,
    "dDurationMs": 13000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. And since I mainly run outside, the overall energy of my day, the mood, those kinds of things feel good too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see. Running really is a great exercise, and it doesn't cost anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, running shoes do cost something, but that's not much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a student who's been running for a really long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're in their 50s now, so they've been doing it for almost their whole life,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and watching them, what I felt was that exercise itself has meaning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when you exercise, you keep paying attention to what you eat and your health."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since it leads to those things, it seems good in other ways too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that does seem right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You naturally think, I should eat protein. More than carbs, since I exercised, I should eat this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You keep thinking about it. So maybe that's why exercise is meaningful. Maybe it has meaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. Yes. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I paid attention to what I ate too, last year. What do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I haven't paid attention to that in so long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1409000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I also tend to pay attention to what I eat pretty often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always try to eat clean when possible. And I don't drink much alcohol either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I don't really drink cola or soft drinks like that. I only drink water, or sometimes milk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you order chicken?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1434000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just eat the chicken by itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hamburger?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just eat the hamburger by itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1443000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't order a set?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. I don't eat it. I don't even understand why people eat it anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow. So that can happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1453000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. What's interesting is that I really ate all of that when I was younger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really drank all that cola and stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even when I was just resting, I'd open cola and carbonated drinks like that and drink them by myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I don't do that anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But do you know this? There's a fitness YouTuber called Fitbly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fitbly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know that video where he ate cheese balls for the first time? That video?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wasn't that during COVID?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. He's a fitness trainer, and there's this video where he eats cheese balls for the first time and almost tears up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's because you got used to it and forgot about it. You forgot. You can forget about that delicious taste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1513000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow. You're so healthy. I'm jealous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1519000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you don't pour carbonated drinks like that into your body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you exercise consistently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since you have to exercise the next day, you think about managing your condition so you try not to go to bed too late."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1537000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you try to go to bed as early as possible. You care about your condition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1543000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But after doing that, it's like you forgot the taste of cola."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551000,
    "dDurationMs": 12000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That strange feeling from back when you were in bad condition? Getting irritated easily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Feeling lethargic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Feeling lethargic and tired and not being able to concentrate. You forget about those things too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then sometimes something special happens or there's a special event and your pattern breaks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you feel it all over again at that moment. Your body feels so tired and lethargic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1589000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each time, I realize once again that it doesn't suit me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need to exercise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think was the most helpful thing? When exercise became a habit and health became a habit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1606000,
    "dDurationMs": 11000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it would be different for each person, but the experience closest to what Didi asked earlier is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I told you my body was very weak. Even now my body isn't extremely good, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1625000,
    "dDurationMs": 14000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then it was unusually weak, and at that time, as much as I exercised, I could easily see my body improving and getting better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639000,
    "dDurationMs": 14000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was so hard when doing it and the muscle soreness was so painful and difficult, but as much as that, when I looked in the mirror my appearance looked a bit more presentable, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1654000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was so fun. So in the beginning of this long period, I did it with that kind of joy, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1664000,
    "dDurationMs": 12000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then somehow after that, I also found joy in the things I felt from the act of exercising itself, those thoughts, things like that, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It changed one by one like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1680000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It would definitely be fun if you can see it. You're doing well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I was doing public service, I was at the Gijang County Office, and at that county office there weren't just public service workers, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1696000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are soldiers called full-time soldiers who wear military uniforms and live a military life,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1704000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Friends who commute to the county office. There are soldiers like that too. Like office workers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But those guys also form groups of three or four among themselves and go around,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was exercising and really enjoying it as a hobby, and when one of them passed by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was quite a while later. After I entered the county office. A stranger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as he just passed by, that soldier in military uniform"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1735000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Said, \"Wow, you've gotten really big.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I felt kind of proud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Me? Like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"You've gotten really big.\" And he went on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that must have felt good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It felt really good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's the taste of it. I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that was also one of many opportunities, one of the reasons I came to like exercising more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1766000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are many pleasures in life like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1769000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to know. The joy of exercise. I hope I'll understand it someday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1776000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If there are people listening to this podcast who really, really love exercising,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd really like you to share a lot about the appeal of exercise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for people like me who don't like exercise, I hope listening to Taeyong's words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will give us some motivation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1794000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would be great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next week's topic is creating a playlist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll think a bit more about what kind of playlist to make,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1806000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we'll create a podcast where the two of us discuss making one playlist together as our goal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1815000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so today we've talked about exercise from all angles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1821000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and next week we'll have a time where we talk about music from all angles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this has been Didi and Jeong Taeyong. Thank you."
    } ]
  } ]
}
